Per-Short numbers:
{stats_table}"' and add the line 'Rank Shorts by Stayed to watch first, then average percentage viewed. Name the 2 hooks to repeat and the 2 to drop. Say 'too few Shorts to tell' when fewer than 6 have numbers.' 4) calina_batch: add the table's top 3 and bottom 3 hooks to the task (same place the earlier titles and rejection notes already go in). 5) Later, optional: the YouTube Analytics API could fill the form, but it needs an OAuth sign-in the owner has not set up; not now.
